en attacked\u2014and tougher foes take multiple hits to dispatch. Learn the pattern of each new fretful fiend to keep the music flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073250/extras/9b3e9b4973ee53c78b60cd1e6c8f9a42.avif?t=1771462010\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073250/extras_big/9b3e9b4973ee53c78b60cd1e6c8f9a42.avif?t=1771462010 width=800 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Showstopping Music:</strong> Brand new soundtrack with 40+ Rhythm Rift tracks by Danny Baranowsky, Jules Conroy, Alex Moukala, Josie Brechner, Sam Webster, and Nick Nausbaum with more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty that Scales with You:</strong> Four intensity levels for each Rhythm Rift - EASY, MEDIUM, HARD, and IMPOSSIBLE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race to the Top:</strong> Climb your way to the top of global leaderboards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Music:</strong> Create your own custom beat maps with the actual developer tools our designers use!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> Once you\u2019ve conquered our hand-crafted levels, challenge your sight-reading with <strong>Remix Mode</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remix Mode throws a fresh beatmap your way every playthrough while retaining the original level's rhythmic design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remix mode also makes <strong>DAILY CHALLENGES</strong> possible, by changing up the circumstances for each song. Play the same random seed as every other player that day and see how you rank on global leaderboards!</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid